&lt;div&gt;Own the end-to-end Finance data architecture: from ODS ingestion through CDM transformation to reporting mart, with clear data lineage documented at every layer&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgkaBwlwcA6aHSeIZKU2dPWc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
